Subject: [PATCH 1/5] Study 15c step 2: the plan and scripts for the
 grid-difference ladder (30, 20, 10 m rows, aggregation, scoring)

Scripts that run the quality map's standard scenario at 30, 20 and 10 m with the
per-cell arrival time saved, aggregate the rows into one small container per site
and score whether the complexity score predicts where the grids differ. The plan,
including the development and hold-out sites and what counts as a positive result,
is committed before any 10 m or 20 m row is scored. Nothing under src/ changes.

